  MyHealthOpinions — Healthcare Professionals mail system v1  ("Clinical Chart")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 01. Verify email & set password
  File       : respondent.liquid
  Class      : Auth — transactional, no unsubscribe
  Trigger    : New healthcare professional registered; email not yet verified
  Replaces   : respondent.liquid (MFR)

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Verify your email to activate your MyHealthOpinions professional account
    2. {{ user.name.first }}, one step left to activate your account
    3. Confirm your email address and set your password

  PREHEADER
    Confirm your address and choose a password. The link is valid for 24 hours.

  PLAIN-TEXT PART
    dist/text/respondent.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.

  Generated from src/content/templates.js + src/design/ — edit those and run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.
===============================================================================
